## Benefits

| Aspect | Before | After |
|--------|--------|-------|
| **Code DRY** | ~800 lines (dup) | ~400 lines (module) + ~100 lines (root) |
| **Maintainability** | Manual sync of identical blocks | Single source of truth |
| **Environment parity** | Manual validation | Enforced by module parameters |
| **State complexity** | 30+ top-level resources per env | Organized under `module.environments[env]` |
| **Horizontal scaling** | Copy-paste, high error risk | Add entry to `environments` map |

